Arthritis of the shoulder — AAOS (@med-source-arthritis: 0, is #reference, #part-of @medicine-sources) { r_7B3XNZ2YPTDVPMN3M6DH7R8S2M
American Academy of Orthopaedic Surgeons, OrthoInfo. Arthritis of the Shoulder. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/arthritis-of-the-shoulder/).

Introduces AC and glenohumeral arthritis and different disease mechanisms, including osteoarthritis, inflammatory disease, post-traumatic disease, and cuff tear arthropathy. Interpret treatment discussions within the specific diagnosis and evidence.

